on Wait ticks
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 57 .............................. startTimer()
  [  5] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  8] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 10] getparam 0 .............................. <ticks>
  [ 12] lt ...................................... <the timer < ticks>
  [ 13] jmpifz [ 23] ............................ repeat while the timer < ticks
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 18] extcall 58 .............................. nothing()
  [ 21] endrepeat [  5]
  [ 23] ret
end
